{"name": "Mice Crisis", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The town is in danger, and the mice are out of control! Step into the paws of a brave cat in Mice Crisis, hunt down endless waves of mice, defeat corrupted predators that stand in your way, and become the hero the town desperately needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"46\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/f1034c9201e6cc5eb46385c0e54dc769.webp?t=1780739736\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Progress through a variety of unique environments! Each area brings fresh challenges to overcome as you advance from one stage to the next!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/0bdffa29ec90af0775d736aff8b65176.poster.avif?t=1780739736\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/0bdffa29ec90af0775d736aff8b65176.webm?t=1780739736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/9b50e1109511e09d4eaf547b8046939c.webp?t=1780739736\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your sharp instincts and quick reflexes to chase, pounce, and clear out swarms of rodents. No mouse is too fast for the town\u2019s hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/30c420634741096d33fdf7164c3d62ae.poster.avif?t=1780739736\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/30c420634741096d33fdf7164c3d62ae.webm?t=1780739736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/f0e2d8356808d7f500e0287794b91c88.webp?t=1780739736\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You aren't the only hunter out there. Face off against predators that have been corrupted by the chaos! Use your skills to defeat them and reclaim the streets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/0aadae38814a54d47601b25ecf86dc37.poster.avif?t=1780739736\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/0aadae38814a54d47601b25ecf86dc37.webm?t=1780739736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/77efd3e4694c8a650cb3d6f6bf351298.webp?t=1780739736\" width=\"600\"/></span><br/>The chaos has trapped many of your fellow animals! Find and rescue your friends hidden throughout the town. A hero never leaves a friend behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/5688e7e07d2ff9d17a5129b3264a5f63.poster.avif?t=1780739736\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/5688e7e07d2ff9d17a5129b3264a5f63.webm?t=1780739736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/5688e7e07d2ff9d17a5129b3264a5f63.mp4?t=1780739736\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"46\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/4c4fae6878f52d5da96901c01c864704.webp?t=1780739736\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rise up, sharpen your claws, and become the legendary hero the town desperately needs! You will bring peace back to your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/af788e27cd227a232130d140f3bb7a9f.poster.avif?t=1780739736\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/af788e27cd227a232130d140f3bb7a9f.webm?t=1780739736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181830/extras/af788e27cd227a232130d140f3bb7a9f.mp4?t=1780739736\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Mice Crisis is a cute and chaotic action game where you play as a heroic cat on a mission to save the town! Hunt down swarms of mischievous mice, smacking corrupted predators, and saving the town in fast paced, adorable action!", "header_image": "https://share